@startuml
title RF63 — Times especiais · Diagrama de sequência
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
autonumber
actor "Head coach / manager (usuário autenticado)" as Manager
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
boundary "API" as API
control "UseCase" as UseCase
control "MatchSimulator" as MatchSimulator
database "MySQL 8" as MySQL
database "Redis 7" as Redis
Manager -> Frontend: abre times especiais
Frontend -> API: GET /careers/{id}/special-teams
API -> UseCase: GetSpecialTeamsUseCase
UseCase -> MySQL: unidades, depth chart, elenco
UseCase --> API: SpecialTeamsView
API --> Frontend: 200
Manager -> Frontend: salva unidade
Frontend -> API: PUT /special-teams/{kind}
API -> UseCase: UpdateSpecialTeamsUnitUseCase
alt incompleta ou indisponível
  API --> Frontend: 422
else senão
  UseCase -> MySQL: UPDATE special_teams_unit
  API --> Frontend: 200
end
note over UseCase: na partida MatchSimulator usa a unidade e a estratégia do snapshot
MatchSimulator -> Redis: estado: chute
MatchSimulator -> MatchSimulator: KickResolver: distância, retorno, bloqueio, onside
MatchSimulator -> Redis: posse, campo, placar
@enduml
